WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.641
WITH CHECK OPTION enforces the view's filter for
writes through the view If an

00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:11.089
update would make a row no longer satisfy the active
equals true condition PostgreSQL rejects

00:00:11.102 --> 00:00:16.848
the write This turns the filtered view into a more
controlled write interface

00:00:18.571 --> 00:00:22.084
It does not replace general database constraints or
permissions
